<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah stared at the note, incapable of grinding the gears of her brain into processing it.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Captain Denver said, \'91Ah!\'92 and presented an index finger to the ceiling. He plucked the note back and scribbled on its reverse side.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The thing Captain Denver scribbled made more sense to Sarah than the contents of the other side.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>He had signed his autograph.\

